{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parable Academy is a 2.5D tag team fighter with only one attack button. A Fabled curse has swept the world... ordinary teens have begun transforming into characters from their favorite classic stories. In order to keep these young people safe from their own curses, a university was set up - Parable Academy for Fabled Youths! Can these students survive the constant attacks from literature's greatest villains?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/2888ff336ff8e4f1e71166808636a2d7.poster.avif?t=1771160024\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/2888ff336ff8e4f1e71166808636a2d7.webm?t=1771160024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/2888ff336ff8e4f1e71166808636a2d7.mp4?t=1771160024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple movement controls and a single button to use for all attacks, Parable Academy is incredibly easy for newcomers to pick up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press the attack button with a direction to use your fighters' special moves, or hold the button for longer to unleash powerful Supercharge attacks!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/b6f681d9307d29f7f325f44704fd15bf.poster.avif?t=1771160024\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/b6f681d9307d29f7f325f44704fd15bf.webm?t=1771160024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/b6f681d9307d29f7f325f44704fd15bf.mp4?t=1771160024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 8 playable fighters from classic fiction to choose from at launch, you'll have the opportunity to master plenty of unique playstyles!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Alice</strong> uses a variety of tools including the Vorpal Sword, a flamingo croquet mallet, and a mad teacup barrage to perform strong bread and butter  (or perhaps,  bread-and-butterfly) combos!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>Creature</strong> harnesses the power of lightning to stun opponents, and comes alive with his devastating throws!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <strong>Wendy</strong>, you'll believe you can fly with bonus air mobility. Grab foes' shadows to drag them across the screen, and clap your hands to summon fairies that carry opponents away!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Willie</strong> can play a silly symphony on the opponent with his powerful ranged attacks including steam whistles, music notes, and stretchy arms!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>Dorothy</strong>'s Silver Shoes to execute precision teleportation, and wear the Golden Cap to call limited-use favors from the Winged Monkeys!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <strong>Gatsby</strong>, pop some corks to temporarily buff your mobility and change the properties of certain attacks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Scheherazade</strong>\u00a0can use her storybook to summon thieves and legendary Rocs, controlling the field and supporting her team with her djinn Supercharge!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...And more to come!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/7ab90e965d15e272544209b44f8b5133.poster.avif?t=1771160024\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/7ab90e965d15e272544209b44f8b5133.webm?t=1771160024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/7ab90e965d15e272544209b44f8b5133.mp4?t=1771160024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up your tag meter by attacking opponents. You can use your meter to tag at any time, even tagging mid-combo to chain multiple characters' attacks together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, you can use your tag meter while under attack to bring in a teammate and punish the opponent - but take care that you don't get multiple fighters trapped in the enemy's moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With three fighters per team, there's no limits to the team optimizations you can hone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/6315ce1b12c440bc3b17aef5fac954d9.poster.avif?t=1771160024\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/6315ce1b12c440bc3b17aef5fac954d9.webm?t=1771160024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/6315ce1b12c440bc3b17aef5fac954d9.mp4?t=1771160024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parable Academy has full voice acting for all playable fighters, and unique storybook-style cutscenes for each character's Arcade Mode intro and ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorite teams to run through Parable Academy's multiple single-player modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: If you want to test out the game's controls and online netcode, download the free demo! Customization badges, unlockable content and single-player modes are locked to the full game.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Count Orlok","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3626300/b952ed03b8046f07043bd7df17b8b3717e11132e.jpg"},{"name":"Doughboy","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3626300/45cef5092e9f43599b7a9d8b48ddd459c7775629.jpg"},{"name":"Excessively Delayed","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3626300/ecc6a79e2fc9760e2fd6b6270f09221ad9cb1236.jpg"},{"name":"Icy Shut-In","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3626300/f50cdde867b71252246d41cac7fa882415dfdfc8.jpg"},{"name":"Ifrit's Bargain","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3626300/e1cf015fa8f4563311778864bb71519a9c010959.jpg"},{"name":"Musical Extravaganza","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3626300/8785b483e906ba82b976b64b406753791adb000c.jpg"},{"name":"Playing Hooky","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3626300/d73604753beeec0da3b36c96a8e3be642862b8af.jpg"},{"name":"Trolley Troubled","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3626300/d4fdd30a06a4e4f1cb4e7565e3128bbd3493c605.jpg"},{"name":"Dracula (Fighter)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3626300/fe3bf8e1c8940b6c287b3c87004484c236ad2040.jpg"},{"name":"Alice (Figurine)","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3626300/63048ff96c7d4955d737d42ee974c617cf9c12f9.jpg"}],"total":17},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3626300?t=1771160024","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/3375a10da56762c49ae8bba08d379ad9e926b26f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771160024","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/44d7f7ce2f73f813e8eccec20a4f7bec5bf35966/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771160024","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/44d7f7ce2f73f813e8eccec20a4f7bec5bf35966/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771160024","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3764020,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parable Academy is a 2.5D tag team fighter with only one attack button. A Fabled curse has swept the world... ordinary teens have begun transforming into characters from their favorite classic stories. In order to keep these young people safe from their own curses, a university was set up - Parable Academy for Fabled Youths! Can these students survive the constant attacks from literature's greatest villains?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/2888ff336ff8e4f1e71166808636a2d7.poster.avif?t=1771160024\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/2888ff336ff8e4f1e71166808636a2d7.webm?t=1771160024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st