\" ><strong>Willie</strong> can play a silly symphony on the opponent with his powerful ranged attacks including steam whistles, music notes, and stretchy arms!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use <strong>Dorothy</strong>'s Silver Shoes to execute precision teleportation, and wear the Golden Cap to call limited-use favors from the Winged Monkeys!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As <strong>Gatsby</strong>, pop some corks to temporarily buff your mobility and change the properties of certain attacks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Scheherazade</strong>\u00a0can use her storybook to summon thieves and legendary Rocs, controlling the field and supporting her team with her djinn Supercharge!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >...And more to come!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/7ab90e965d15e272544209b44f8b5133.poster.avif?t=1771160024\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/7ab90e965d15e272544209b44f8b5133.webm?t=1771160024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/7ab90e965d15e272544209b44f8b5133.mp4?t=1771160024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build up your tag meter by attacking opponents. You can use your meter to tag at any time, even tagging mid-combo to chain multiple characters' attacks together!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively, you can use your tag meter while under attack to bring in a teammate and punish the opponent - but take care that you don't get multiple fighters trapped in the enemy's moves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With three fighters per team, there's no limits to the team optimizations you can hone!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/6315ce1b12c440bc3b17aef5fac954d9.poster.avif?t=1771160024\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/6315ce1b12c440bc3b17aef5fac954d9.webm?t=1771160024\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/extras/6315ce1b12c440bc3b17aef5fac954d9.mp4?t=1771160024\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Parable Academy has full voice acting for all playable fighters, and unique storybook-style cutscenes for each character's Arcade Mode intro and ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorite teams to run through Parable Academy's multiple single-player modes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NOTE: If you want to test out the game's controls and online netcode, download the free demo! Customization badges, unlockable content and single-player modes are locked to the full game.</p>","developers":["Snuffysam Media"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3626300/bb7be7f342af3e900042fb9f594c681ec0d1b366/header.jpg?t=1771160024","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> MacOS Sequoia 15.3.2<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core Dual 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></u